  "weekly_summary": {
    "items": [
      {
        "deck_links": [
          {
            "deck": {
              "archetype_id": "mono-red-madness",
              "deck_fingerprint_sha256": "6ab95cc40cb336564cc757a69e8fff7f6617a001431d45bbe5d728b191b7e5b1",
              "deck_id": "001b5e95e804d5c303b9",
              "display_name": "Mono-Red Madness",
              "event_id": "12853676",
              "final_rank": 1,
              "player": "Mogged",
              "starttime": "2026-09-04 13:00:00.0"
            },
            "label": {
              "en": "Mono-Red Madness · Mogged · Rank 1",
              "zh": "纯红疯魔 · Mogged · 第1名"
            },
            "order": 1,
            "token": "deck:001b5e95e804d5c303b9"
          }
        ],
        "order": 1,
        "text": {
          "en": "Mono-Blue Terror and Mono-Red Madness have been at the top of the Pauper metagame lately, but Mono-Blue Terror fell behind a little this week, with less than 10% of Top 8 finishes. Meanwhile, Mono-Red Madness accounts for nearly 30% of high-score decklists and a quarter of the Top 8 field. Its share of Top 8 finishes over the last four weeks also exceeds 20%, a substantial presence in Pauper’s traditionally diverse metagame. And it is delivering results as well as numbers: it reached the Top 4 in four of this week’s five events and won three of them: deck:001b5e95e804d5c303b9. Could this be a sign that the metagame is starting to lose its balance?",
          "zh": "最近纯铁环境顶端一直是纯蓝惧兽和纯红疯魔两套牌，而本周纯蓝惧兽稍有掉队，八强占比甚至没有超过10%。但纯红疯魔高胜占比已经接近30%，八强占比也有四分之一。近四周的平均八强占比更是已经超过20%。这在一直相对比较开放的纯铁环境是相当有分量的数据。而且并不只是数量上压倒，质量也很强。本周五场比赛只有一场四强中没有纯红疯魔，而疯魔席卷了其中的三场：deck:001b5e95e804d5c303b9。不知道这是不是意味着环境已经开始失衡。"
        }
      },
      {
        "deck_links": [],
        "order": 2,
        "text": {
          "en": "However, Wizards announced last week that The Zeta Set’s downshifted cards would be allowed into Pauper after all. The decision followed community feedback and an effort to keep Pauper’s legality rules simple. Two cards considered too powerful were banned preemptively: [[card:Narcomoeba|Narcomoeba]], for its synergy with [[card:Dread Return|Dread Return]] in Spy decks, and [[card:Price of Progress|Price of Progress]], for its excessive burn efficiency. The other ten cards—[[card:Baleful Strix|Baleful Strix]], [[card:Vandalblast|Vandalblast]], [[card:Dispatch|Dispatch]], [[card:Cut Down|Cut Down]], [[card:An Offer You Can't Refuse|An Offer You Can't Refuse]], [[card:Serra Angel|Serra Angel]], [[card:Return to Dust|Return to Dust]], [[card:Sengir Vampire|Sengir Vampire]], [[card:Gigantosaurus|Gigantosaurus]], and [[card:Soul-Guide Lantern|Soul-Guide Lantern]]—will enter the format. They became legal in tabletop Pauper on September 7, but implementation on Magic Online must wait until the September 23 update. Keep in mind that tabletop and MTGO metagames may differ substantially during this interval.",
          "zh": "不过，威世智在上周又发文称，Zeta系列的牌又进纯铁了。做出这个决定主要是赛事小组倾听了社区声音后，并且尽量维持纯铁合法性规则简洁。有些过于离谱的牌：[[card:Narcomoeba|梦生阿米巴]]（配合探子[[card:Dread Return|颤栗再现]]），[[card:Price of Progress|进步的代价]]（烧的效率过高），还是提前被禁了。但[[card:Baleful Strix|恶邪枭]]、[[card:Vandalblast|蛮野冲击]]、[[card:Dispatch|迅速了结]]、[[card:Cut Down|斩落]]、[[card:An Offer You Can't Refuse|无法拒绝的条件]]、[[card:Serra Angel|撒拉天使]]、[[card:Return to Dust|终归浮尘]]、[[card:Sengir Vampire|辛格氏吸血鬼]]、[[card:Gigantosaurus|巨太龙]]、[[card:Soul-Guide Lantern|导灵明灯]]这10张牌还是会进入环境。实体牌正式合法已经在9月7日开始，但MO由于系统原因要等到9月23日才能上线。所以这之间的时间段，实体环境和MO环境会有较大差别，需要注意。"
        }
      }
    ],
    "week": "2026-W36"
  }
}
